  "original_lyrics": "[verse]\nOoooh! Sugar Pie, Honey Bunch, You know that I love you\nI can't help myself, I love you and nobody else\n\n[intro]\nLeaving just your picture behind....(ooh), and I've kissed it thousand times (ooh)\nWhen you snap your finger, or wink you eye, I come -running to you\nI'm tied to your apron strings, and there's nothing that I can do\nI can't help myself, no, I can't help myself,\n'Cause, Sugar Pie Honey Bunch, I'm weaker than man should be\nI can't help myself, I'm fool in love 'ya see\nWanna tell you I don't love you, tell you that we're through, and I try....\n\n[bridge]\nWhen I call your name, girl, it starts to flame, burning in my heart, tear'n it all apart..\nNo matter how I try, my love I cannot hide....\n'Cause Sugar Pie Honey Bunch, you know that I'm waiting for you (waiting for you)\nI can't help myself, I love you and nobody else\nSugar Pie Honey Bunch, I' do anything you ask me to (ask me to)\nI can't help myself, I want you and nobody else\nSugar Pie, Honey Bunch, you know that I love you (I dooo)\nI can't help myself..., No... I can't help myself",
